[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11643.229, "timestamp": "03:14:03", "text": "这。哦。我的天啊。什么？看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11654.15, "timestamp": "03:14:14", "text": "什么？太酷了。但我不能接受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11656.87, "timestamp": "03:14:16", "text": "虽然空间很大。我会杀人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11658.429, "timestamp": "03:14:18", "text": "我。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11661.59, "timestamp": "03:14:21", "text": "等待。但是但是但是但是但是看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11663.309, "timestamp": "03:14:23", "text": "内部的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11666.41, "timestamp": "03:14:26", "text": "尽管。这是一个整体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11667.71, "timestamp": "03:14:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11670.269, "timestamp": "03:14:30", "text": "巨像。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11674.63, "timestamp": "03:14:34", "text": "为什么？为什么建筑物的形状是这样的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11677.67, "timestamp": "03:14:37", "text": "像这样？哇。好的。总之，呃，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11680.07, "timestamp": "03:14:40", "text": "来这里是为了寻找灵感，对吧？所以，呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11681.15, "timestamp": "03:14:41", "text": "我们来吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11684.55, "timestamp": "03:14:44", "text": "看。我可以这样砌墙，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11687.51, "timestamp": "03:14:47", "text": "但我的墙是……但我看不见"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11690.349, "timestamp": "03:14:50", "text": "虽然是在户外。哟，怎么了"}]